	"data": "Northeastern University — MS in Extended Realities (XR)\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research.\n\nOverview\n\nNortheastern University's MS in Extended Realities (XR) is one of the first dedicated graduate programs in immersive computing in the United States. Housed in the College of Arts, Media and Design (CAMD) in collaboration with the Khoury College of Computer Sciences, it sits at the intersection of technology, design, and human experience. The program…",
